findings.citation_text:
4-601.11(C) Equipment, Food-Contact Surfaces, Nonfood-Contact Surfaces, and Utensils. Observed the following require cleaning:

- The sliding track of the drink cooler (soiled with food crumbs);
- The interior of the microwave (soiled with accumulated sauce/food splashes);
- The interior of the upright, two door freezer (soiled with accumulated sauce spills and food crumbs) THIS IS A FIRST REPEAT VIOLATION;
- The outside of the bulk salt and sugar containers by the hand sink (soiled with food splash and dried sugar/salt).  

(C) NonFOOD-CONTACT SURFACES of EQUIPMENT shall be kept free of an accumulation of dust, dirt, FOOD residue, and other debris.

findings.comment:
750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) WALKIN COOLER - 1. shelving (food splash/debris), 2. rolling rack (food splash/debris), & 3. gray storage tub by door (splash/food debris);
B) shelving next to freezers (white powder/grimy buildup);
C) bulk powder and rice storage bins (splash/white powder);   and
D) fryers - sides, underneath surfaces and inside lower compartment around mechanicals (grease/food debris).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

findings.citation_text:
750.1200 & 1220 - A) Floor under fryers was soiled with grease, and a tiles under the fryers were loose. Clean under the fryers and replace loose floor tiles.

B) Drain under the 3 part sink was soiled with mold/debris buildup. Clean the drain under the 3 part sink.'

C) Floors were soiled in the following areas with food splash/debris and/or grease:
1. walkin cooler (along walls/under shelves);
2. under cooking equipment;
3. along wall under prep cooler;
4. behind chest freezer;   and
5. storage area by the back door.
Clean the floors throughout as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.
